<title>AUSTRALIA: TOP 20 AUSTRALIAN DIVIDEND YIELDS - AUGUST 14.</title>
<headline>TOP 20 AUSTRALIAN DIVIDEND YIELDS - AUGUST 14.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     RIC	Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	14.79    1.69</p>
<p> 2   Davids Limited	 11.63    0.86</p>
<p> 3   Cudgen R.Z.	    10.42    2.40</p>
<p> 4   Natl Consol	    10.34    0.87</p>
<p> 5   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 6   Prime Credit Tr	 8.66    1.12</p>
<p> 7   Prop Income Inv	 8.62    1.17</p>
<p> 8   Natl In Prop	    8.33    1.08</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   8.32    1.02</p>
<p>10   Gandel Retail Tr	8.23    0.96</p>
<p>11   Gen Prop Tr	     8.18    2.47</p>
<p>12   Schroder Prop	   8.15    2.27</p>
<p>13   Holyman		   8.09    2.35</p>
<p>14   Centro Prop	     8.09    2.38</p>
<p>15   Colonial Coml	   8.05    2.30</p>
